OL,3,GNEWSAAttendance row councillor resigns
OL,4,Aover ill health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor who said he was too ill to
OL,7,Fattend meetings and then attended one
OL,8,Fin time to avoid losing his seat has
OL,9,Fresigned.
OL,11,FGraham Jeffery, a Liberal Democrat who
OL,12,Frepresents Hutton ward on Redcar and
OL,13,FCleveland Council, was said to suffer
OL,14,Ffrom a lung condition and received
OL,15,Fadvice to avoid large indoor events and
OL,16,Fair conditioned places.
