OL,3,GNEWSAAttendance row councillor resigns
OL,4,Aover ill health
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors previously rejected a
OL,7,Frequest for a third six-month exemption
OL,8,Ffrom in-person council meetings, but he
OL,9,Flater stood in for another councillor
OL,10,Fat a committee meeting, effectively
OL,11,Fresetting the clock.
OL,13,FA by-election to replace Jeffrey, who
OL,14,Fhas also been a Conservative and
OL,15,Findependent during 19 years on the
OL,16,Fcouncil, could be held as early as
OL,17,FDecember.
